<title>THAILAND: Thai Dec foreign reserves fall to US$38.7 bln.</title>
<headline>Thai Dec foreign reserves fall to US$38.7 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's foreign reserves fell in December to US$38.7 billion from $39.6 billion in November, the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    THAI FOREIGN RESERVES     Dec 96     Nov 96     Dec 95</p>
<p>					 38.7	 39.6	 37.0</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in U.S. dollars.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
